        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic panel for PVT, single-Si, without flat glass, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic panel for PVT, single-Si, without flat glass, at regional storage
Shares of production in Europe (15%) and import from APAC (6%) and China (79%). ALL WITHOUT FLAT GLASS! ONLY FOR USE IN PVT-SYSTEM!;
Synonyms: Solarmodul nur für PVT-Systeme, PV-module for PVT systems only, cadmium telluride, thin film, WITHOUT FLAT GLASS; 
UUID: b56ab465-b4a4-3f61-9e6b-5a656327a4e6
Consumption mix for use in Europe ONLY FOR PVT-SYSTEM (all the pv-modules are WITHOUT FLAT GLASS)!! Transport of modules from overseas.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Modern production plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer and literature data  on worldwide module production. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b56ab465-b4a4-3f61-9e6b-5a656327a4e6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
